ulnerable&lt;/span&gt; enemy can be [[File:Lift icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Lifted&lt;/span&gt; and [[File:Knock Down icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Knocked Down&lt;/span&gt; to add more Vulnerable stacks (up to 4). Hitting a Vulnerable enemy with [[File:Crush icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Crush&lt;/span&gt; or [[File:Breach icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Breach&lt;/span&gt; will &lt;u&gt;consume&lt;/u&gt; the Vulnerable stacks.\" data-title=\"Vulnerable\" data-color=\"1\" data-name=\"Vulnerable\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#DFBB92\">[[File:Vulnerable icon.png|15px|link=]]Vulnerability</span> <span style=\"color:\n#8DA2DF\">stacks <span class=\"glossary\" data-desc=\"Various Physical and Arts debuffs can be ended early. For example, [[File:Crush icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Crush&lt;/span&gt; consumes [[File:Vulnerable icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Vulnerable&lt;/span&gt; debuffs, while [[File:Combustion icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#FF8E59'&gt;Combustion&lt;/span&gt; consumes &lt;span style='color:#33C2FF'&gt;Arts Infliction&lt;/span&gt; debuffs.\" data-name=\"Debuff Consumption\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\">consumed</span> from one enemy]</span> for 20s. If the target already has <span class=\"glossary\" data-desc=\"Physical Susceptible targets temporarily take more &lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Physical DMG&lt;/span&gt;. The number represents the degree of increase. Effects of the same type can stack.\" data-title=\"Physical Susceptibility\" data-color=\"1\" data-name=\"Physical Susceptibility\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#DFBB92\">[[File:Physical Susceptibility icon.png|15px|link=]]Physical Susceptibility</span>, is <span style=\"color:\n#FFAE6B\">Staggered</span>, or has attached <span class=\"glossary\" data-desc=\"The Endministrator's Combo Skill attaches Originium Crystals to enemies and immobilizes them.\" data-title=\"Originium Crystal\" data-color=\"9\" data-name=\"Originium Crystal\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#33C2FF\">Originium Crystals</span>, increase the aforementioned buff to <span style=\"color:\n#8DA2DF\">1.5</span> times. This buff cannot stack."
