link=]]&lt;span style='color:#30D6E0'&gt;Cryo Infliction&lt;/span&gt;\" data-title=\"Arts Reaction: Solidification\" data-color=\"5\" data-name=\"Solidification\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#00C0CB\">[[File:Solidification icon.png|15px|link=]]Solidification</span>, the wearer gains <span style=\"color:\n#00C0CB\">Cryo DMG</span><span style=\"color:\n#8DA2DF\"> +50%</span> for 10s. The aforementioned effects cannot stack."
