e:Electric Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]/[[File:Cryo Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]) + [[File:Nature Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#B4D945'&gt;Nature Infliction&lt;/span&gt;\" data-title=\"Arts Reaction: Corrosion\" data-color=\"6\" data-name=\"Corrosion\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#9CD54A\">[[File:Corrosion icon.png|15px|link=]]Corrosion</span>, the wearer gains a number of buff stacks equal to the <span class=\"glossary\" data-color=\"9\" data-desc=\"Status Level is the number of &lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Vulnerable&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span style='color:#33C2FF'&gt;Arts Infliction&lt;/span&gt; stacks (max 4) &lt;u&gt;consumed&lt;/u&gt; when triggering a &lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Physical Status&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span style='color:#33C2FF'&gt;Arts Reactions&lt;/span&gt;. The higher the &lt;span style='color:#33C2FF'&gt;Status Level&lt;/span&gt;, the stronger the resulting &lt;span style='color:#D3B591'&gt;Physical Status&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span style='color:#33C2FF'&gt;Arts Reactions&lt;/span&gt;.\" data-name=\"Status Level\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#33C2FF\">Status Level</span> of the Arts Reaction consumed, with each buff stack giving <span style=\"color:\n#FDC038\">Electric DMG Dealt</span> and <span style=\"color:\n#9CD54A\">Nature DMG Dealt</span> <span style=\"color:\n#8DA2DF\">+15%</span> for 25s. The number of buff stacks maxes out at 3 stacks. Duration of each stack is counted separately."
